    LLM: 'Game: Gou Ji (Team climbing with duels). Players: 6 (2 teams of 3). Deck: 4Ã—52 cards + 8 Jokers (216 total). Deal: 36 cards per player. Card rank: Red Joker > Black Joker > 2 > A > K > Q > J > 10 > 9 > 8 > 7 > 6 > 5 > 4 > 3. Play: Combinations of same rank. Gou Ji (powerful combos): 5+ tens, 4+ jacks, 3+ queens, 2+ kings, 2+ aces, 1+ joker. Duel: When Gou Ji played, only direct opposite rival can beat it. Scoring: Finishing order determines points. Tribute: Losers give high cards to winners for next round.',
    Player: "Welcome to Gou Ji, the epic Chinese card game. You're on a team of three playing against another team. Climb by playing card combinations. But beware: powerful combinations (Gou Ji) trigger duels with your direct rival. First team to empty their hands wins. Points: 1st=4, 2nd=2, 3rd-4th=0, 5th=-2, 6th=-4.",
    objective: 'Be the first team to empty your hands. Points are awarded based on the finishing order (1st to 6th).',
